      "content": "Sure, here's a few more:\n\n4. **Alek Yilmaz** - Sold out of his homeland for a better life, Alek finds solace in running the corner spot with his lover Manon, feeding off the cash they've made side jobs. A keen street-smarts match to his keen bun rises faster than it can be picked off by drunken Italians or local cops. And like for you, Alek is a real stickler for the cash and never works the deal twice.\n\n5. **Caridad \"Cicuta\" Torres** - A young woman known to tickle the ears of many but only ever words to two men, cicuta serves up her notorious empanadas and soft-spoken gossip in equal measure. Working the corner, she's made a name for herself. Corners of the city know to keep their nose out, as cicuta's appetite is never satiated and neither is the hunger she feeds.\n\n6. **Jimmie \"Tiny\" Lee** - Jimmie is Korean-American by the fifth-generation but doesn't mind soaking up the neighborhood's objectionable blackness quite so much. He's younger, almost child-like, yet his gambling and sex work prowess far outstrips his age. He's",
